From c00ed96eeb2dacff1436becc67b227da6e569a60 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lccc-agent <agent@arena.invalid>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:48:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/66] i686 asm: fold base-less constant chains like GAS
