From 6deeab14c4874ca89f7982df0d28816034e050f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lccc-agent <agent@arena.invalid>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:39:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 34/66] vec_interleave: interleave unguarded SSE2 widening sums

The early vectorizer's unguarded SSE2 widening step
(`VecWidenAddValueI32x4ToI64x2`, I64x2 accumulator) was not an interleave
root, so `long s += a[i]` over `int a[]` ran one dependent paddq chain at
