From 30b36e80f554bd1b086c0ab992c7fc10f867ea3e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lccc-agent <agent@arena.invalid>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:24:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 61/66] lowering: small vector call results through ?:, comma
 and ({ })

On x86-64 a call that returns a GNU vector of at most 8 bytes yields the
packed register bits, not the address every other vector rvalue yields;
each consumer spills them (`rhs_is_small_vector_call`). A conditional,
comma or statement expression forwarded those bits unchanged, but the
consumers recognise only a bare call, so they dereferenced the bits:
`T r = c ? v : f();`, `(c, f())` and `({ f(); })` segfaulted in
initialisers, assignments, casts, arithmetic, compound assignment,
comparisons, aggregate initialisers and stores through pointers, at every
-O level (60 consumer x wrapper probes; only arguments and subscripts
survived). `(long long)f()` failed even for a bare call.

The wrapper now spills the carrier once, in `lower_expr`
(`spill_packed_vector_wrapper`), so it yields an address like every
other vector rvalue, and `expr_produces_packed_struct_data` reports
vector-typed wrappers as address-producing to match (the argument spill
and the conditional's own arm normalisation ask it). Struct wrappers are
unchanged: their consumers already handle the packed carrier. The
vector-to-scalar cast goes through `vector_operand_ptr`, which spills a
packed bare call, and so does the vector-to-vector cast: its same-size
path returned the packed bits as the cast's value, so
`((U4)f())[1]` and `_mm_extract_pi16(_mm_add_pi16(a, b), 1)` (whose
macro casts to `__m64` once that is a vector) dereferenced them.

`__builtin_shuffle` packed its result for every vector of at most 8 bytes
on every target, while its consumers follow `call_result_is_packed`,
which is false on 32-bit targets: on i686 `T s = __builtin_shuffle(v, m)`
dereferenced the lane bits. It now packs only on x86-64.

Found through the `__m64` ABI gate leg (next commit): the lccc caller of
`boundary.c` crashed on `mode ? indirect(ARGS) : boundary(ARGS)`.
`vector_small_packed_wrappers{,_m32}.c` run every consumer x wrapper pair
for both condition values, plus 4-byte, float and shuffle shapes and
`__m64` intrinsics; the old compiler crashes on both at every -O level.
